Subject: [PATCH] tests: add zebra_linkdown_nhg topotest

Verify that zebra sets and clears the linkdown flag of kernel routes when the carrier of a bond interface is lost and regained, including for a route that was added while the bond had no carrier.

Signed-off-by: Manoharan Sundaramoorthy <manoharan@nexthop.ai>
---
